# ANT CLAW BUILD VALIDATION 10X

## Pipeline

- Connect Gradle dependencies
- Replace placeholders with Android implementations
- Assemble debug APK
- Run emulator tests
- Fix compile issues
- Generate APK artifact
- Run performance benchmarks

## Verification Targets

Startup:
- App launch timing

Runtime:
- UI stability
- Memory usage
- Database operations
- Network handling

Release:
- Signed APK
- Artifact upload
- Installation test
